column34:
{+}*Summary*{+}:

{color:#000000}The Tube Control Application Program ([T|https://192.168.3.34/cnfl1/display/DS/ESTAP+Main+Application?src=contextnavpagetreemode]{color}{color:#000000}[CAP|https://192.168.3.34/cnfl1/display/DS/TCAP+Main+Application]) {color}{color:#000000} is comprised of the TCAP controller and TCAP Graphical User Interface (GUI). The TCAP GUI is what the operator uses to control the movement of the tube 9 and tube 10 hatches{color}. It is responsible for providing the visuals needed to for operators to conduct SSW mission operations. The TCAP GUI allows operators to view the live status of the Tube Control System (TCS). It also allows operators to send commands open/close tube hatches, open/close valves, and override sensor values. The purpose of this milestone is to document the design for all the units of TCAP GUI.

{color:#ff0000}Each page that is displayed will be considered a unit. We will need sub-unit pages to capture specific/key variations of a given unit page. Should be re-evaluated before tasks are added into the PI.{color}

{+}*Project Impact*{+}:

{color:#000000}What Problem Does this Solve{color}
 * {color:#000000}Design documentation for common code used in the TCAP CSCI.{color}
 * {color:#000000}Provides clarity for safety teams, stakeholders and developers{color}

{color:#000000}How does this fit into the larger project{color}
 * {color:#000000}This documentation will be included in the TCAP SDD. {color}

{+}*Implementation Overview*{+}:

{color:#000000}High Level Overview{color}
 * {color:#000000}The TCAP design pages will document the design of the Tube 10 Control Page and all the React Components within.{color}
 ** {color:#000000}Tube Visual Component {color}
 *** {color:#000000}Automatic Valve Command Button/Status Indicator {color}
 *** {color:#000000}Manual Valve Status Indicator {color}
 *** {color:#000000}Tube Liquid Level Indicator {color}
 *** {color:#000000}Hatch Locked Indicator {color}
 *** {color:#000000}E-Stop indicator {color}
 ** {color:#000000}Valve Command Modal  {color}
 ** {color:#000000}TCS Status Sidebar{color}
 ** {color:#000000}Commands Sideba{color}{color:#000000}r{color}
 ** {color:#000000}Navigation Menu (Bottom){color}

{color:#000000}Key Components/Docs{color}
 * {color:#000000}TCAP GUI Component{color}

 * 
 ** Front End Unit
 *** Tubes
 **** Tube 10

