 * {color:#000000}Lack of Developer Knowledge of GUI design and structure{color}
 * {color:#000000}Lack of Understanding on how to design / organize GUI design pages.{color}

{color:#000000}*Completion Criteria:*{color}

{color:#000000}Specs{color}
 * {color:#000000}Pre-designs pages created for all components using the approved {color}{color:#000000}[Design Page Guidelines|https://192.168.3.34/cnfl1/display/DS/Design+Doc+Guidelines]{color}{color:#000000} {color}
 ** {color:#000000}Examples of completed design pages in include {color}[Card I/O Manager Design Page|https://192.168.3.34/cnfl1/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=106300846] and [PM/FL Design Page|https://192.168.3.34/cnfl1/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=106303616]  

 * {color:#000000}EACH unit (page component) has a design page, not just the  MAIN PG!{color}

{color:#000000}Outputs{color}
